

# ── Subject ────────────────────────────────────|── 72 hard limit ────|
#
# ── Body: wrap at 72 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────|
#
# 50: GitHub Desktop warns beyond this
# 72: GitHub truncates the subject in the commit list beyond this
# 72: body wrap fits git log's 4-space indent on an 80-column terminal
#
# ── Conventional Commits types ────────────────────────────────────────
#   feat      New feature
#   fix       Bug fix
#   refactor  Code improvement without behavior change
#   docs      Documentation, including code comments
#   test      Add or change tests
#   perf      Performance improvement
#   style     Formatting, lint fixes
#   chore     Maintenance, dependencies, tooling
#
# ── Rules ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   Subject:  imperative mood, no period, lowercase after type
#   Scope:    optional, such as feat(tmux) or fix(zsh)
#   Body:     explain why, not what
#   Footer:   Breaking-Change: / Co-Authored-By: / Refs: #issue
